Package: hopla
Title: Genomic Family Analysis and Interactive Reporting
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lennart", "Raman", email = "leraman@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses single- and multi-sample variant call format files for
    family relationships, variant quality, copy number, Mendelian errors, and
    pedigree haplotypes. Produces a self-contained interactive HTML report and
    provides tools for comparing and transforming haplotype flow tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CenterForMedicalGeneticsGhent/Hopla
BugReports: https://github.com/CenterForMedicalGeneticsGhent/Hopla/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    base64enc,
    data.table,
    DNAcopy,
    GenomicRanges,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    kinship2,
    plotly,
    RColorBrewer,
    scales,
    tools,
    utils,
    vcfR,
    yaml
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Merlin 1.1.2 (optional; Linux only)
